From f64561ca66d48edbb6dd2be00ad593a10e9b7d75 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 12:53:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] refactor: reorganize scripts into feature folders and fix
 forgotten wiring

- Move scripts into Core/Match/UI/_Legacy (GUIDs preserved via .meta moves)
- FighterController: raise OnHealthChanged so HUD health bars update
- FighterHitbox: remove duplicated hit/log blocks, split into helpers
- UIManager: add PVPM_MENU_MAPSELECTION screen slot
- GameManager: drop unused using, simplify first-state guard
- AttackData: remove unused attackRange field
- FighterCombat: fix CancelAttack indentation
- EGameState: fix copy-paste comments
